<title>ITALY: Italy President sees Prodi, no details.</title>
<headline>Italy President sees Prodi, no details.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian President Oscar Luigi Scalfaro received Prime Minister Romano Prodi for talks on Thursday, the presidential office said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said Prodi was accompanied by cabinet undersecretary Enrico Micheli. The statement gave no other details.</p>
<p>--Rome newsroom +39 6 6782505</p>
